    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d172">

                <pb facs="0277" n="203" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg203"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/570</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Petrograd</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-10-06T17:00:00+03:31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">October 6, 1917, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received October 7, 3.55
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1842. Awaiting reply to my 1808, September 27, 11 p.m.<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d172-f1"/> New Ministry will be announced to-day or to-morrow to
                    which opposition unlikely, after which Allied Ambassadors will present to the
                    Government joint note of the character outlined. They will act jointly October
                    9, without me unless I am authorized to unite therein.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
